Suggests: lm-sensors, smartmontools, nvme-cli, vulkan-tools, flatpak, gamemode, mangohud, gamescope
Description: modular Linux desktop administration toolkit
 Linux Admin Center (LAC) provides an interactive terminal interface and
 command-line options for common Linux desktop administration tasks.
 .
 It includes update management, system and network information, read-only
 diagnostics, gaming compatibility checks, service health, cleanup reporting
 and a self-check for the installed runtime.
